  "awb---faq-data": "<div data-rt-embed-type='true'><div data-rt-embed-type='true'><script> window.awbFAQ = {\"heading\": \"SaaS Landing Page Questions, Answered\", \"items\": [{\"q\": \"What is a SaaS landing page?\", \"a\": \"A SaaS landing page is a standalone page that sells one software product to one kind of buyer. It asks for one action, usually a trial signup or a demo request, and leaves out the site navigation. Nothing else on the page competes with that button.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you build a SaaS landing page?\", \"a\": \"Decide who the page is for and the one action it asks of them, then describe both to Emergent's <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder'>AI landing page builder</a>. It builds the page and the form, plus a table where each new account lands as a row you can filter. The seven steps on this page cover the decisions to make before that first prompt.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are the best landing pages for SaaS?\", \"a\": \"The best SaaS landing pages make the product's job clear in the first screen and show the real interface doing it. Gallery sites sort examples by section, which helps when you need ideas for a pricing block or a hero. Use them for SaaS landing page inspiration, then test your own version against your signups.\"}, {\"q\": \"How do you write a SaaS landing page?\", \"a\": \"Start with the buyer and the single action, then write each section to move that buyer toward it. Borrow the headline from words customers use on sales calls, and cut any section that answers a question nobody asked. Label the button with the action itself, such as Start my trial.\"}, {\"q\": \"What is the best template for a SaaS landing page?\", \"a\": \"The best one is built around the action you want. A trial page puts the signup form near the top, while a page that books demos needs room for proof before the ask. On Emergent the finished page is code you can push to a GitHub repository on a paid plan.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are SaaS landing page best practices?\", \"a\": \"SaaS landing page best practices start with the promise in the ad: repeat it in the headline, word for word where you can. Keep the form short enough to finish on a phone, and test one change at a time. Link a <a href='https://emergent.sh/ai-landing-page-builder/pricing-page'>pricing page</a> from the header for visitors who want the numbers first.\"}, {\"q\": \"What are good sources of SaaS landing page inspiration?\", \"a\": \"Look at the pages of tools your buyer already pays for, since those set what the buyer expects to see. Pricing pages and onboarding emails from software companies you admire teach more about structure than a hero screenshot does. Keep a file of the lines you would steal and note why each one works.\"}, {\"q\": \"What should a software landing page include?\", \"a\": \"Above the fold, a software landing page needs a headline that names the job and a screenshot of the product doing it. Further down come proof, pricing, and the signup form, then a thank you page that tells each new account what to try first. On a page Emergent builds, every signup is stored in a database you own.\"}, {\"q\": \"Are SaaS landing page templates worth using?\", \"a\": \"Yes, when the launch date is close and the layout is what slows you down. Open the template on a phone before you commit to it. Plan to replace every line of sample copy, because a visitor can tell when a headline was written for someone else.\"}, {\"q\": \"Where can I find a SaaS landing page template?\", \"a\": \"Design communities and builder galleries offer free SaaS landing page templates you can copy. A template fixes the layout and leaves the copy and the signup logic to you. Good SaaS landing page design starts from your buyer and your product screens, which is why Emergent starts from a description instead of a template.\"}]}; </script></div></div>"
 }
